WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.880
Someone once said...

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:55.290
There are pigs with meat the 
texture of a tender lobster...

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.830
Pigsters!

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:06.000
There are lions with a sweet 
mane like a Mont Blanc cake...

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.140
Mont Blions!

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:13.010
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:17.850
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:26.650
Thinking that he would need 
Zebra's help to get Mellow Cola,

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.590
Toriko headed off with 
Komatsu to Honey Prison.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.990
Komatsu was shocked when he learned 
the reason for Zebra's incarceration.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:35.960
Toriko...

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:41.000
After I eat these guys, I'll 
wanna moisten my throat a bit.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.500
Then how about goin' to drink some cola?!

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.340
They rode a Lift House on a one-month journey

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:52.110
to get to the Sand Garden, 
site of the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:59.350
Warning! Zebra Has Disembarked 
at the Sand Garden!

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.690
Gourmet News!

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:07.630
This is today's Zebra report.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.400
First, when we look at 
the Zebra outlook chart,

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:15.930
it seems he's slowly moving over the 
Valley of Dust towards the Sand Garden.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.100
And now, the Zebra forecast for all areas...

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.470
There's a 100% chance that Zebra 
will appear in the Valley of Dust,

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.280
a 40% chance for the Sand Garden,

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:29.550
and an estimated 10-20% chance 
he'll show up in any other area.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:34.250
It's expected that he'll arrive 
at the Sand Garden in one month.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:38.620
Residents of the area, please be careful.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.930
And now, sports!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.160
Carrie-san, over to you!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.500
The second I get back from my trip on the 
Gourmet Carriage, there's this panic.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.500
I wish somebody would give me 
a heaping helping of a break!

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.370
Toriko...

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:56.470
If he got off at the Gate to the 
Underworld... then he must be with Zebra!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.290
Nothin' to do...

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.260
Hey, Toriko. Let's fight.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.360
Forget it. Just sit there quietly.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.830
Oh, come on! It's been a while!

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.800
Why do I have to fight 
with you for no reason?!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.410
'Cause fighting is everything to me!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.770
That's got nothin' to do with me!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:36.180
And we rented such an 
expensive guest house...

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.380
How 'bout this, Toriko?! Huh?!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.180
Man, you're a pest!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:50.790
They're going to charge us an 
arm and a leg for the repairs...

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.100
Come on, bring it!

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.960
Zebra-san is so wild...

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.140
Would you go with me to see Zebra?!

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:01.200
No way!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:04.740
I can see why Coco-san 
and Sunny-san refused...

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.280
What about Coco and Sunny?!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.010
N-Nothing!

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.910
H-He really does have sharp ears!

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.720
Moving's made me hungry. Food!

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:20.490
Right!

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:34.070
So you really did eat those 
Execution Beasts, huh?

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:36.700
That must be why you've 
gotten a lot stronger.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.440
You're the one who's gotten stronger, Toriko.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:44.740
I'm glad there's still someone 
I can scrap with on equal terms.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:51.120
I-I made a ton of food... and 
it's already all but gone!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.050
Kid, there ain't enough here!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.550
R-Right!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.260
He's already gone through 
so much of my stock.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:00.630
And this is only our third day out...

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:05.000
We still have just shy of a month 
to go. I hope the food holds out...

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:11.270
I had my eye on that meat!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.810
Ask me if I care!

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:19.710
Never mind the food. I don't know if 
this Lift House will last a month...

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.490
We're almost at the Sand Garden.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.030
It looks like our food supply 
will barely be enough...

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:42.870
And somehow, the Lift House 
is still hanging together...

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.270
I'll pretend I didn't see that.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:56.410
Huh. The Sand Garden sounds 
like an interesting place!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.750
I found a sightseeing guidebook on the shelf.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.920
I knew that it was a famous sightseeing spot,

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.690
but I didn't know it has 
all kinds of deserts.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.530
Like the Rice Desert, made 
from all-natural rice...

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.870
And the Brown Sugar Desert, 
made of sweet brown sugar...

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.470
And it looks like there are a lot of other

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:22.440
deserts too that are made from edible sand.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:28.480
But it's not all Gourmet Deserts like the 
Rice Desert and Brown Sugar Desert...

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.680
There's the Coal Desert, 
the Rare Earth Desert,

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:32.950
and the Natural Resources Desert.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:38.050
There's also the Gold Dust Desert, the 
Diamond Desert, and the Jewel Desert.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:43.090
The Sand Garden is also 
called "Sand Paradise".

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:47.530
And we're almost there! I'm really 
starting to look forward to it!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.660
Hey!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.140
Kid...

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:54.540
Yes?!

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.840
Aren't you gettin' a little cocky?!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.940
No, I'm not! Not one bit!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.150
I see...

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.980
Listen, kid...

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.380
I'm gonna tell you something 
before we get to the desert.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.820
Think of me as an environment.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.490
An environment?

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:18.090
That's right. Any animals 
that can't adapt to me well

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:21.160
will end up goin' extinct.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:25.270
That's the law of nature. Got it?

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.700
Y-Yes...

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.200
Don't pay attention to him, Komatsu!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.910
You don't need to adapt to Zebra!

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.610
Toriko! You haven't adapted at all!

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:38.780
Zebra-san...

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:43.120
...is clearly different from 
Toriko-san and the other Four Kings.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.690
This man is a dangerous criminal...

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:51.330
If you don't adapt, I'll 
punch the crap outta you!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.590
I'm uneasy about this after all...

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.000
Is it really going to be okay?

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.730
Bringing Zebra-san along...

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.070
It looks like we're here.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.070
Sand Garden...

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.840
Somehow, we made it.

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.710
B-Barely made it...

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.650
Sure is hot...

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.920
Yeah. I hear the low is higher 
than 60 degrees all day long.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.320
So this is the Sand Kingdom...

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:04.260
Z-Zebra!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.860
Hey, what are you lookin' at?

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:09.670
I'll knock your block off!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.770
J-Just spare my life!

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:14.410
Alright, I'll let you live.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:16.740
But in exchange, gimme something to eat.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:20.110
Take me to a good Sand Cuisine restaurant!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.580
Hey, hey...

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.250
Toriko-san...

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:27.180
It'll be okay... with Zebra-san, won't it?

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.290
What do you mean?

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.120
Well... um...

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.890
Are you worried?

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:36.260
Well, he is a full-fledged criminal.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:40.260
So I understand why you can't trust him.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.800
Trust... It's more...

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.340
Zebra-san has incredibly sharp hearing. 
He can clearly hear everything.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.310
But...

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.140
What's wrong, Komatsu?

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:53.780
I...

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:59.580
I think that Zebra-san's 
crimes are extremely serious.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:02.850
To be honest, I don't think he should 
have been released from prison.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:08.790
I don't see a bit of remorse in Zebra-san, 
so going on a trip with him...

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.190
I can't agree with it!

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:15.660
It's over...

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.500
He already thinks I'm being cocky...

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:22.370
Komatsu, I feel the same way.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.270
Toriko-san?!

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:29.610
But we really need him 
for the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.180
This is a give-and-take situation.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.420
B-But...

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.520
Besides...

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:42.160
...it's not like Zebra's existence 
poses a threat to the whole world.

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:47.160
Even when he single-handedly made 
26 different species go extinct?

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:50.360
Hurry up and get me some 
delicious Sand Cuisine!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.770
R-Right away!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.470
It's hot...

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:04.380
Toriko-san, where are we headed?

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:08.680
I want to get us equipped before 
we head into the desert...

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:14.220
This is a major street, so you'd think 
there would be rows of street stalls...

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:16.690
Toriko-san!

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:20.160
Shaved ice!

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:23.060
Welcome!

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:26.630
Why, this is Sand Ice!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.370
Sand Ice?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.700
Yeah. Sand Ice doesn't melt, 
even under the blazing sun.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.740
Give us two of 'em, man!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:34.710
With pleasure.

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:37.880
If it doesn't melt, then how can we eat it?!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.610
There you are.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:41.210
Thank you for the food!

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:44.180
This stuff melts when it's stimulated.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:49.690
In other words, it suddenly melts when 
you break it apart with your teeth.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:51.820
It's cold and delicious!

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:54.190
Thank you for the food!

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:00.370
You're right! What is 
this refreshing flavor?!

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.770
It's sweet and delicious 
like sugar candy, right?

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.210
Brain freeze!

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.870
You two have a good appetite!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:17.050
It's been a long time since I've 
had such satisfied customers.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:18.780
I'm glad.

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.820
Hey, I'd like to get us 
equipped for our trip...

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.020
...but I haven't seen any shops.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.420
Yeah.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.430
The number of tourists has gone way down.

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:32.160
So everyone's closed up their shops.

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:36.100
Oops! Don't mean to get all gloomy on you...

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:40.370
I've got it! I can basically set you up.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.310
Really?!

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:42.910
Leave it to me!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:52.920
We look like we fit in here! And 
it's a lot cooler with this on...

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:56.050
The turban and cape doesn't 
just protect you from the sun.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.490
At night, when it goes down to 
about 40 degrees in the desert,

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:01.490
they give you some protection from the cold.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:06.030
I've also prepared a few more things for you.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.030
What's this?

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.100
That's called a Pellot.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.500
Come to think of it,

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.640
there are statues that look like 
this in town here and there.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:21.380
That's because a Pellot is a Gourmet charm.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:26.280
If you carry it with you, you'll never 
get lost, not even in a vast desert.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.950
Komatsu, should we bring it along?

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:30.850
Yes!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.290
Hey! You don't need the gun or sword?

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.490
Going to the desert without a weapon 
is the height of recklessness.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.730
Nah, we don't need that stuff.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.700
More importantly, what about 
transportation through the desert?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.130
I'm sorry. I couldn't prepare that for you.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:50.140
If you walk about five kilometers 
north, though, there's one more town.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.910
You may be able to get transportation there.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.780
I see. Alright, let's check that place out.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.680
Thanks for all your help.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:14:59.410
Thank you very much!

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:01.480
Be careful out there.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:02.150
Right!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.630
Are you alright, Komatsu?

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.230
Y-Yeah...

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:17.260
Um... What about Zebra-san?

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.870
He'll catch up on his own.

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:24.170
I think I see it. That's it, isn't it?

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.550
Toriko-san, is that...

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.380
"Camels for Rent"...

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.990
We wanna rent a couple camels...

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:48.230
You're the first customers I've had 
in a long while. Thank you for coming.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.400
Which desert are you going to?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:56.400
Though to be honest, the ones I 
can recommend are quite limited.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:57.840
Is that right?

00:15:57.840 --> 00:15:58.670
Yes.

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.740
This is a lonely town...

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:03.780
Terrible, isn't it?

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.440
Oh, no...

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:09.250
You can see how the town is.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.550
A conflict between our country 
and another lasted years...

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.090
Was it a war?

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.390
Yes. That's right.

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.130
And because of that, we 
hardly get any tourists now.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:24.360
Almost no one uses the Lift 
Houses either these days.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:26.500
That's why...

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:31.300
That Lift House hadn't been used for years.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:37.070
That's terrible... Worse than terrible...

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:40.040
But it's alright now...

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.580
The war is over.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:45.820
Thanks to that one person...

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.020
Hey, Toriko!

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:52.620
You bastards left me behind!

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:53.660
Zebra-san!

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.690
You're the one who went off on his own!

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.530
D-Did you just say "Zebra"?!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:02.230
Yes, but you don't have to be afraid.

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.470
As long as you don't get cocky...

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:07.240
That person... is Zebra-sama?!

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:09.970
Zebra... <i>sama</i>?!

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:11.710
Zebra-sama?!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.380
Zebra-sama is here?!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.140
Zebra-sama!

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:16.210
Zebra-sama!

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:19.150
Zebra-sama! Our savior, Zebra-sama!

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.780
H-Hey! What's this?!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.050
What is this...?!

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:28.060
Zebra saved this town.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.060
Well, that was the result, anyway.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.560
What do you mean?

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:34.700
It was to prepare for Zebra...

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.430
Countries that were at war with each other...

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.370
...heard about Zebra's release

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.300
and called a truce so they could 
take measures against Zebra.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.740
And so, all military forces 
returned to their own country.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.680
So they could protect their 
country from Zebra...

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:57.250
Many lives were lost in 
this town from the war.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.990
Truly, every day was hell.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.290
But I'm so glad he ended it for us...

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.790
It's all thanks to Zebra-sama.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:09.260
Zebra-sama is our savior!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.730
Get away from me! You're annoying!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.300
Wanna get a crack upside the face?!

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:52.940
B-Biological weapon!

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:56.280
A creature is a weapon?!

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:00.350
It's attacked this town a number of times!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.920
My son and grandchild were both...

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:07.820
As long as that thing is around, 
this town has no future!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.760
The ravages of war...

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:16.530
Eight Tailed Scorpion (Crustacean 
Beast) Capture Level 23

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.530
That's an Eight-Tailed Scorpion!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:21.170
With its eight poisonous tails, it 
can kill all types of creatures,

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:23.100
and wreak havoc on ecosystems!

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:28.770
It's been designated a quarantine-class, 
level-two dangerous creature!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:58.900
Voice Cutter!

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:09.180
An inferior creature shouldn't get cocky!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.150
Thank you...

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:28.030
That reminds me, Komatsu...

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:32.740
The 26 species of creatures 
that Zebra's annihilated...

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:37.240
...were all dangerous creatures that 
messed up ecosystems, I believe.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.440
Dangerous... creatures?

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:42.710
But that doesn't mean it's 
alright to kill them off...

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.380
Zebra-sama!

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.380
Bastards!

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.690
You better adapt to me!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.560
Zebra-san...

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:06.930
Dishing with Tina!

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:10.360
Today, on "Dishing with Tina", we're 
going to do a day in the life segment

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:14.900
General Manager of the 
IGO owned Hotel Gourmet

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:14.470
featuring the general manager of Hotel 
Gourmet, where Chef Komatsu works.

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:20.610
Even now, the general manager sweeps 
the entrance early ever morning.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:23.540
He looks up at the sky...

00:22:23.810 --> 00:22:26.550
Where did Chef Komatsu go?!

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:28.080
He checks the books...

00:22:28.550 --> 00:22:31.420
Chef Komatsu, where are you?!

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:33.120
Even as he's scolded by his superior...

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:36.260
Chef Komatsu, where did you go?!

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:38.020
After work...

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:40.790
Where did you go, Chef Komatsu?

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:45.000
His sole concern is the 
return of Chef Komatsu.

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:50.770
We can't serve Century Soup unless 
Chef Komatsu comes back...

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:53.070
All we can do is have faith and wait.

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:57.510
Even the penguin cries when it looks 
at the single-minded general manager.

00:22:57.980 --> 00:22:59.680
But where exactly is Chef Komatsu

00:22:59.680 --> 00:23:02.010
that the general manager 
worries so much about?

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:04.420
That will be revealed in the next segment.

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:09.130
A wasteland stained crimson red.

00:23:09.130 --> 00:23:13.290
The scorching desert traps Toriko's group in a maze with no exit.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:16.760
Komatsu Disappears! Devilish Desert Labyrinth!

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:18.520
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
